{"lines": [{"text": "You pay five dollars for a coffee.", "start": 0.5, "end": 2.372, "spec": null, "words": [["You", 0.091, 0.159], ["pay", 0.159, 0.352], ["five", 0.352, 0.659], ["dollars", 0.67, 0.943], ["for", 0.943, 1.057], ["a", 1.057, 1.091], ["coffee", 1.102, 1.534]]}, {"text": "Where does that money actually go? Let's follow every cent.", "start": 5.2, "end": 8.392, "spec": null, "words": [["Where", 0.091, 0.148], ["does", 0.159, 0.25], ["that", 0.25, 0.42], ["money", 0.42, 0.898], ["actually", 0.898, 1.193], ["go", 1.205, 1.511], ["Let's", 1.875, 1.989], ["follow", 1.989, 2.284], ["every", 2.295, 2.477], ["cent", 2.489, 2.875]]}, {"text": "The beans, the milk and the cup usually cost well under a third of the price.", "start": 8.692, "end": 13.108, "spec": null, "words": [["The", 0.091, 0.17], ["beans", 0.17, 0.761], ["the", 0.943, 1.034], ["milk", 1.045, 1.398], ["and", 1.534, 1.602], ["the", 1.614, 1.693], ["cup", 1.705, 1.932], ["usually", 1.943, 2.33], ["cost", 2.33, 2.739], ["well", 2.75, 2.977], ["under", 2.977, 3.148], ["a", 3.148, 3.182], ["third", 3.182, 3.432], ["of", 3.432, 3.477], ["the", 3.489, 3.545], ["price", 3.557, 4.091]]}, {"text": "Roasting, shipping and the farmer's share are all packed into that small slice.", "start": 13.408, "end": 17.92, "spec": null, "words": [["Roasting", 0.08, 0.614], ["shipping", 0.852, 1.352], ["and", 1.352, 1.409], ["the", 1.409, 1.466], ["farmer's", 1.466, 1.841], ["share", 1.841, 2.114], ["are", 2.125, 2.239], ["all", 2.33, 2.545], ["packed", 2.545, 2.955], ["into", 2.955, 3.08], ["that", 3.08, 3.25], ["small", 3.261, 3.557], ["slice", 3.568, 4.17]]}, {"text": "But a café doesn't just sell coffee. It sells a seat, a warm room and ten quiet minutes.", "start": 18.22, "end": 23.836, "spec": null, "words": [["But", 0.091, 0.136], ["a", 0.136, 0.182], ["café", 0.182, 0.693], ["doesn't", 0.705, 0.966], ["just", 0.966, 1.114], ["sell", 1.114, 1.273], ["coffee", 1.273, 1.716], ["It", 2.091, 2.148], ["sells", 2.148, 2.364], ["a", 2.364, 2.42], ["seat", 2.42, 2.818], ["a", 3.045, 3.102], ["warm", 3.114, 3.523], ["room", 3.523, 3.807], ["and", 4.023, 4.17], ["ten", 4.25, 4.523], ["quiet", 4.534, 4.818], ["minutes", 4.818, 5.284]]}, {"text": "Rent for a busy corner is one of the biggest single costs.", "start": 24.136, "end": 27.304, "spec": null, "words": [["Rent", 0.068, 0.205], ["for", 0.205, 0.33], ["a", 0.33, 0.364], ["busy", 0.364, 0.636], ["corner", 0.648, 1.08], ["is", 1.341, 1.443], ["one", 1.443, 1.545], ["of", 1.557, 1.602], ["the", 1.602, 1.693], ["biggest", 1.739, 2.034], ["single", 2.045, 2.261], ["costs", 2.261, 2.841]]}, {"text": "Then the barista. Wages, taxes and training are often the biggest slice of all.", "start": 27.604, "end": 32.548, "spec": null, "words": [["Then", 0.091, 0.25], ["the", 0.25, 0.295], ["barista", 0.295, 0.864], ["Wages", 1.239, 1.83], ["taxes", 2.023, 2.523], ["and", 2.523, 2.58], ["training", 2.58, 3.0], ["are", 3.091, 3.216], ["often", 3.25, 3.591], ["the", 3.591, 3.705], ["biggest", 3.705, 3.989], ["slice", 3.989, 4.284], ["of", 4.284, 4.352], ["all", 4.352, 4.614]]}, {"text": "Add electricity, the machine, cleaning, and the card fee you paid just by tapping.", "start": 32.848, "end": 37.768, "spec": null, "words": [["Add", 0.091, 0.193], ["electricity", 0.193, 0.909], ["the", 1.148, 1.205], ["machine", 1.216, 1.761], ["cleaning", 1.909, 2.443], ["and", 2.705, 2.784], ["the", 2.795, 2.864], ["card", 2.875, 3.136], ["fee", 3.148, 3.261], ["you", 3.261, 3.352], ["paid", 3.352, 3.727], ["just", 3.886, 4.045], ["by", 4.057, 4.148], ["tapping", 4.159, 4.58]]}, {"text": "Whatever is left is the owner's profit, often only a few cents on the dollar.", "start": 38.068, "end": 42.892, "spec": null, "words": [["Whatever", 0.091, 0.409], ["is", 0.409, 0.523], ["left", 0.523, 0.955], ["is", 1.25, 1.341], ["the", 1.341, 1.443], ["owner's", 1.511, 1.784], ["profit", 1.784, 2.261], ["often", 2.67, 3.0], ["only", 3.011, 3.284], ["a", 3.284, 3.33], ["few", 3.341, 3.636], ["cents", 3.636, 3.943], ["on", 3.943, 4.011], ["the", 4.023, 4.08], ["dollar", 4.08, 4.489]]}, {"text": "Slow mornings make it worse, because rent and staff cost the same when the line is empty.", "start": 43.192, "end": 48.304, "spec": null, "words": [["Slow", 0.091, 0.33], ["mornings", 0.33, 0.67], ["make", 0.67, 0.841], ["it", 0.852, 0.909], ["worse", 0.92, 1.341], ["because", 1.352, 1.716], ["rent", 1.716, 2.114], ["and", 2.239, 2.341], ["staff", 2.341, 2.773], ["cost", 2.773, 3.114], ["the", 3.125, 3.193], ["same", 3.205, 3.636], ["when", 3.818, 3.909], ["the", 3.92, 4.0], ["line", 4.011, 4.284], ["is", 4.284, 4.409], ["empty", 4.409, 4.773]]}, {"text": "That's why the pastry sits next to the till. Extra items cover fixed costs far better than coffee.", "start": 48.604, "end": 54.34, "spec": null, "words": [["That's", 0.091, 0.227], ["why", 0.227, 0.318], ["the", 0.318, 0.398], ["pastry", 0.409, 1.045], ["sits", 1.057, 1.352], ["next", 1.352, 1.659], ["to", 1.659, 1.705], ["the", 1.705, 1.773], ["till", 1.773, 2.102], ["Extra", 2.466, 2.761], ["items", 2.773, 3.159], ["cover", 3.159, 3.398], ["fixed", 3.409, 3.693], ["costs", 3.705, 4.182], ["far", 4.25, 4.591], ["better", 4.602, 4.841], ["than", 4.841, 4.955], ["coffee", 4.955, 5.398]]}, {"text": "So you're not really paying for the coffee. You're paying for the corner, the people and the time.", "start": 54.64, "end": 59.536, "spec": null, "words": [["So", 0.091, 0.182], ["you're", 0.182, 0.273], ["not", 0.273, 0.489], ["really", 0.5, 0.67], ["paying", 0.67, 1.023], ["for", 1.034, 1.102], ["the", 1.114, 1.159], ["coffee", 1.17, 1.614], ["You're", 1.989, 2.068], ["paying", 2.08, 2.42], ["for", 2.42, 2.511], ["the", 2.511, 2.591], ["corner", 2.591, 3.034], ["the", 3.284, 3.386], ["people", 3.386, 3.92], ["and", 4.045, 4.125], ["the", 4.136, 4.193], ["time", 4.193, 4.557]]}, {"text": "Next time you pay five dollars, which part do you think costs the most?", "start": 59.836, "end": 63.484, "spec": null, "words": [["Next", 0.091, 0.216], ["time", 0.216, 0.352], ["you", 0.352, 0.455], ["pay", 0.455, 0.693], ["five", 0.705, 0.989], ["dollars", 0.989, 1.455], ["which", 1.807, 1.966], ["part", 1.966, 2.125], ["do", 2.125, 2.17], ["you", 2.17, 2.273], ["think", 2.273, 2.489], ["costs", 2.5, 2.795], ["the", 2.795, 2.864], ["most", 2.875, 3.318]]}], "dur": 65.48}